@startuml
title SC-ORD-004 — The inventory does not answer
actor Customer as C
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

C -> O : PlaceOrder
O --> C : accepted, order PENDING
O ->> I : ReserveStock
note over I #ECEFF1 : down: the message waits\nin its subscription
... order deadline ...
O -> O : order deadline reached
O ->> I : ReleaseReservation
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, TIMED_OUT
note over P : never called
O ->> N : OrderRejected
== the inventory is back ==
note over I : handles ReserveStock,\nthen ReleaseReservation,\nin the order they were sent
I ->> O : StockReserved
note right of O : saga already ended:\nReleaseReservation is sent again
I ->> O : ReservationReleased
@enduml
